# The boards of a compose site in mode (a), one per line, in the order the site
# lists them. Copy to boards.conf (git ignores it) and fill in:
#
#   <name> <url> [<interval>] [<branch>]
#
# <name> is a lowercase DNS label, unique, and the board's folder under /boards.
# <url> is the board's git remote, cloned anonymously (the .invalid names below
# are placeholders that never resolve). <interval> is the pull interval in
# seconds (default 60). <branch> defaults to the remote's default branch.
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are skipped.
board-a https://git.example.invalid/team/board-a.git 60
board-b https://git.example.invalid/team/board-b.git 60
